  <!-- EN: While powered, this device intercepts certain events — such as raids — before they reach the colony. Its power draw grows with the number of colonists on the map. Each interception puts the device into a long cooldown during which it offers no protection, though it still needs power to cool down. -->
  <FFF_Info_ShieldingDevice.description>TODO</FFF_Info_ShieldingDevice.description>
  <!-- EN: signal broadcast -->
  <FFF_Info_SignalTower.label>TODO</FFF_Info_SignalTower.label>
  <!-- EN: While powered, this device can call a trade ship to visit through its command button. It needs to cool down between uses. -->
  <FFF_Info_SignalTower.description>TODO</FFF_Info_SignalTower.description>
